Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 03:34:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] Let "Ryan" sign in as ryan, and stop iOS capitalising
 usernames

Sign-in now finds an exact username first, then an unambiguous
case-insensitive match. The PIN lockout counts per lowercased name so
changing the case doesn't give extra tries. New usernames can't clash
by case. Username fields turn off autocapitalise and autocorrect.

